SUMMARY:Sunday Afternoon Social
DESCRIPTION:The Sunday Afternoon Social is a once per month recurring Latin dance community event designed to bring dancers together for a relaxed\, high-energy afternoon of music and movement. \n​Event Overview\n​The Vibe: A welcoming afternoon dance social that bridges the gap between weekend workshops and late-night club events. It offers a prime opportunity for local dancers to practice\, socialize\, and enjoy great music without the late-night hours. \n​The Music: The event focuses exclusively on Salsa and Bachata\, catering to both classic and modern flavors of both genres. \n​The Soundtrack: Curated by DJones\, ensuring a seamless flow of tracks that keeps energy high and the dance floor moving throughout the afternoon. \n​The Venue: Hosted at the Bboy Factory (6401 Broadway\, Denver\, CO)\, offering a dedicated space with the right flooring and atmosphere for a proper dance community gathering.
URL:https://golatindance.com/event/sunday-afternoon-social-5/
LOCATION:Bboy Factory\, 6401 Broadway\, Denver\, CO\, 80216\, United States
CATEGORIES:Denver
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://golatindance.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/1000008591.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Chris 'SoDo' Darbin":MAILTO:Chrisdarbin1@hotmail.com
END:VEVENT
